<div class="content">
    <h1>Bank Verification Update Required</h1>

    <p>Hello {{ownerName}},</p>

    <p>
        We've reviewed the bank details you submitted for <strong>{{organizationName}}</strong>, but unfortunately
        we're unable to verify them at this time.
    </p>

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 20px 0; background-color: #fef2f2; border-left: 4px solid #dc2626; padding: 16px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #991b1b; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
                    <strong>Verification Failed:</strong>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #991b1b; margin: 0;">
                    {{rejectionReason}}
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <!-- What You Need to Do -->
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 25px 0; border-left: 4px solid #004aad; padding-left: 16px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <h3 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 12px 0;">
                    Action Required:
                </h3>
                <ul style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>Review the rejection reason carefully</li>
                    <li>Verify that all information is accurate and complete</li>
                    <li>Ensure your bank account is active and in good standing</li>
                    <li>Double-check account holder name matches your organization</li>
                    <li>Update and resubmit your bank details</li>
                </ul>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <!-- Common Issues -->
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 25px 0; background-color: #f0f7ff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <h3 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 12px 0;">
                    Common Issues:
                </h3>
                <ul style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>Incorrect or incomplete bank account information</li>
                    <li>Mismatched account holder name</li>
                    <li>Invalid or incorrectly formatted IFSC code</li>
                    <li>Account number doesn't match bank records</li>
                    <li>UPI ID not linked to the provided account</li>
                </ul>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    {{> button
    url=updateBankUrl
    label="Update Bank Details"
    variant="primary"
    fullWidth=true
    marginTop="20px"
    marginBottom="20px"
    }}

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 20px 0; background-color: #fef3c7; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 16px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #92400e; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
                    <strong>Important:</strong>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #92400e; margin: 0;">
                    You won't be able to create paid events or receive payments until your bank details are
                    verified. However, you can continue creating free events and using all other features.
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <tr>
            <td align="">
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #4b5563; margin: 0;">
                    If you need help with the verification process or have questions, our support team is ready to
                    assist you.
                </p>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #4b5563; margin: 10px 0 0 0;">
                    Best regards,<br />
                    <strong style="color: #1f2937;">- Orgatick Team</strong>
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</div>
